          },
          "code": "DISPLAYITEMAVAILABILITYDETAILS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1768549968276",
          "id": "1767900456007",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767900456008_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given three datasets:\n\n- `withinOrgItems` = `{{$context.$nodes.ITEM_AVAILABILITY_WITHIN_ORGANIZATION.$output.items}}`\n- `otherOrgItems` = `{{$context.$nodes.ITEM_AVAILABILITY_OTHER_ORGANIZATION.$output.items}}`\n- `substituteItems` = `{{$context.$nodes.SUBSTITUTE_ITEM_AVAILABILITY.$output.items}}`\n\nCreate **three separate multiRecordWidgets** under a single section.\n\n**Section title/heading (show once at the top):**\n- Title: **\"Item Availability Elsewhere\"**\n- Heading: **\"Item Availability Elsewhere\"**\n\n### Widget 1: Item availability within current organization\n- **Show this widget only if** `withinOrgItems` exists and has at least one row.\n- Data source: `withinOrgItems`\n- Widget type: `multiRecordWidget`\n- Columns:\n  1) Label: **\"Subinventory (In Current Organization)\"** → field: `Subinventory`\n  2) Label: **\"Quantity\"** → field: `AvailableToTransactQuantity`\n  3) Label: **\"Unit of Measure\"** → field: `PrimaryUnitOfMeasure`\n\n### Widget 2: Item availability in other Organizations\n- **Show this widget only if** `otherOrgItems` exists and has at least one row.\n- Data source: `otherOrgItems`\n- Widget type: `multiRecordWidget`\n- Columns:\n  1) Label: **\"Availability in Other Organizations\"** → field: `OrganizationName`\n  2) Label: **\"Quantity\"** → field: `AvailableToTransactQuantity`\n  3) Label: **\"Unit of Measure\"** → field: `PrimaryUnitOfMeasure`\n\n### Widget 3: Substitute item availability\n- **Show this widget only if** `substituteItems` exists and has at least one row.\n- Data source: `substituteItems`\n- Widget type: `multiRecordWidget`\n- Columns:\n  1) Label: **\"Substitute Item\"** → field: `ItemNumber`\n  2) Label: **\"Subinventory\"** → field: `Subinventory`\n  3) Label: **\"Quantity\"** → field: `AvailableToTransactQuantity`\n  4) Label: **\"Unit of Measure\"** → field: `PrimaryUnitOfMeasure`\n\n**Output requirements:**\n- Output only the widget definitions/configuration required to render these three multiRecordWidgets.\n- Do not include explanations or any text outside the widget configuration."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "TransformData",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "const itemNumber = $context.$nodes.EXTRACTORAAPPCONTEXT.$output.result?.ItemNumber ?? \"\";\nconst orgName = $context.$nodes.EXTRACTORAAPPCONTEXT.$output.result?.OrganizationCode ?? \"\";\n\nconst withinOrgItems = $context.$nodes.ITEM_AVAILABILITY_WITHIN_ORGANIZATION.$output?.items ?? [];\n\nconst acrossOrgItems = $context.$nodes.ITEM_AVAILABILITY_OTHER_ORGANIZATION.$output?.items ?? [];\n\nconst substituteItems = $context.$nodes.SUBSTITUTE_ITEM_AVAILABILITY.$output?.items ?? [];\nlet inputArray = [];\n\n// Single unified array\ninputArray =\n  []\n    .concat(\n      withinOrgItems.map(r => ({\n        type: \"WITHIN_ORGANIZATION\",\n        item: itemNumber,\n        organizationName: orgName,\n        subinventory: r?.Subinventory ?? null,\n        locator: r?.Locator ?? null,\n        availableQuantity: r?.AvailableToTransactQuantity ?? null,\n        unitOfMeasure: r?.PrimaryUnitOfMeasure ?? null,\n\n        // keep other fields present but null for a consistent “input type”\n        organizationCode: null,\n        leadTimeInDays: null,\n        substituteItemNumber: null\n      }))\n    )\n    .concat(\n      acrossOrgItems.map(r => ({\n        type: \"ACROSS_ORGANIZATION\",\n        item: itemNumber,\n        organizationName: null, // across org may not be a single org name\n        subinventory: null,\n        locator: null,\n        availableQuantity: r?.AvailableToTransactQuantity ?? null,\n        unitOfMeasure: r?.PrimaryUnitOfMeasure ?? null,\n\n        organizationCode: r?.OrganizationCode ?? null,\n        leadTimeInDays: r?.LeadTimeInDays ?? null,\n        substituteItemNumber: null\n      }))\n    )\n    .concat(\n      substituteItems.map(r => ({\n        type: \"SUBSTITUTE_ITEM_AVAILABILITY\",\n        item: itemNumber,\n        organizationName: orgName,\n        subinventory: r?.SubinventoryName ?? null,\n        locator: r?.Locator ?? null,\n        availableQuantity: r?.AvailableToTransactQuantity ?? null,\n        unitOfMeasure: r?.PrimaryUnitOfMeasure ?? null,\n\n        organizationCode: null,\n        leadTimeInDays: null,\n        substituteItemNumber: r?.ItemNumber ?? null\n      }))\n    );\n\nreturn inputArray;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770037255768"
          },
          "code": "TRANSFORMDATA",
          "id": "1768556643377",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
